// ── The extern host's frame ─────────────────────────────────────
// The evaluator's way to call a linked C function by name, so a
// program that binds C answers the same under `avra run` as it does
// built. The C is the COMPILER's, not the runtime's — a symbol
// resolver in the runtime would ride inside every binary the compiler
// emits (packages/std-avrac/src/c/ffi.c).

